 "summary": "A 22 nF ±5% chip multilayer ceramic capacitor in the GRM series, with C0G (5C) temperature-stable dielectric and a 50 V DC rating. The body is 2.0 × 1.25 × 1.25 mm (2012M, EIA 0805) with two end terminations, and it may be reflow or flow soldered. It operates from -55 to 125 ℃ and is meant for consumer, industrial, non-implant medical and automotive infotainment equipment.",
